From: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 07:41:01 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mm/damon/paddr: respect folio end for DAMOS_PAGEOUT

Sashiko finding.

[1] https://lore.kernel.org/20260517234112.89245-1-sj@kernel.org

Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
 mm/damon/paddr.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mm/damon/paddr.c b/mm/damon/paddr.c
index 0fdd4de119f73..0b396033e3b3b 100644
--- a/mm/damon/paddr.c
+++ b/mm/damon/paddr.c
@@ -369,7 +369,7 @@ static unsigned long damon_pa_pageout(struct damon_region *r,
 		else
 			list_add(&folio->lru, &folio_list);
 put_folio:
-		addr += folio_size(folio);
+		addr = PFN_PHYS(folio_pfn(folio)) + folio_size(folio);
 		folio_put(folio);
 	}
 	if (install_young_filter)
